35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The post-occupancy reviews show high ratings where any department could book the space.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The booking data confirms specialist rooms are idle, but general rooms are always full.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,The technicians are spending hours on manual checks because the equipment is outdated.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The site diaries show six weeks lost to weather on exposed work.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Tender records show mechanical plant costs rising by a fifth, while surfacing held steady.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Benjamin, does that cost rise apply to the ventilation upgrade?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,The timetable records show we paid for off-site space for two terms.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"The staffing posts for grounds are unfilled, but technicians have spare hours.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Delivery schedules show comfort-based projects slip a year, while inspection fixes are on time.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Yes, the ventilation upgrade involves mechanical plant, so the cost risk is high.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The post-occupancy data suggests we should prioritize spaces with broad access.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. The study commons would have high booking demand based on the data.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"The path network is exposed to weather, which matches the delay risks Mizuki found.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"The path network is also a comfort project, so it likely slips a year.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The media center has no renewal reserve for its AV kit, which is a hidden cost.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"The study commons seems to fit the high-usage, low-delay profile.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,It also avoids the off-site space costs that plagued the lab upgrade.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,"It does not require new grounds staff, which is a relief for the current team.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"It is an indoor project, so weather delays are minimal.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,The costs are more predictable than the mechanical plant in the lab upgrade.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
